## Logstash Performance & Scaling

**Single Logstash Capacity:**
- ~100,000 events/second processing
- Depends on complexity of filters
- More filters = lower throughput

**Scaling Logstash:**

```
Architecture:

┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│       DATA SOURCES                      │
│  - Syslog from 1000+ servers            │
│  - Filebeat from endpoints              │
│  - API feeds                            │
└────────────────┬────────────────────────┘
                 │
         Load Balancer (Haproxy/Nginx)
         │       │       │       │
         ↓       ↓       ↓       ↓
    ┌─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┐
    │     │     │     │     │
