## Troubleshooting

### Cluster Status Red

```
Symptom: Some indices unavailable
Cause: Unassigned shards

Diagnosis:
GET _cluster/health
GET _cat/shards

Solution:
PUT _cluster/settings
{
  "transient": {
    "cluster.routing.allocation.enable": "all"
  }
}
```

### Slow Queries

```
Symptom: Searches taking >5 seconds

Causes:
1. Complex query logic
2. Large result set
3. Low memory/CPU
4. Many shards to search

Solutions:
1. Profile query: GET _search/profile
2. Add time filters
3. Increase heap memory
4. Add data nodes
5. Shrink indices (reduce shards)
```

### High Memory Usage

```
Symptom: Out of memory errors
Causes: Large heaps, many concurrent queries

Solutions:
1. Increase heap (up to 31GB max)
2. Close unused indices
3. Reduce query complexity
4. Add circuit breaker settings
5. Scale horizontally (more nodes)
```

